    "html": "\n<p><strong>Last updated: 12 November 2026.</strong></p>\n<p>Thane is one of the busiest CAT coaching markets in the Mumbai Metropolitan Region, with most centres clustered in Thane West between the railway station, Naupada and Gokhale Road. This guide lists three CAT coaching centres confirmed on the institutes' own official pages as of 12 November 2026, and says plainly what we could not confirm.</p>\n\n<div class=\"tldr-box\"><p class=\"tldr-label\">Quick facts</p>\n<p><strong>City:</strong> Thane, Maharashtra (Mumbai Metropolitan Region)</p>\n<p><strong>Exam covered:</strong> CAT, plus XAT, SNAP, NMAT and MAH-MBA CET where listed</p>\n<p><strong>Institutes listed:</strong> 3, each confirmed on its own official website as of 12 November 2026</p>\n<p><strong>Coaching area:</strong> Thane West: Gokhale Road, Naupada and the station area</p>\n<p><strong>Next exams:</strong> CAT 2026 on 29 November 2026; XAT 2027 on 3 January 2027 (<a href=\"https://www.xatonline.in/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">xatonline.in</a>)</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2>How we picked this list</h2>\n<p>We included an institute only if its own website shows a CAT coaching centre in Thane with an address. Directory sites name more Thane MBA classes, but without an official page we did not rank them. We kept the list to three instead of padding it to ten. Our paid listings get no extra ranking unless they qualify on the same test. If you run or know an institute that should be here, send us its official page and we will check it.</p>\n\n<h3>1. IMS Learning Resources, Gokhale Road</h3>\n<p>IMS's <a href=\"https://www.imsindia.com/center/mumbai\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">official Mumbai centres page</a> lists IMS Thane at Ground Floor, Shop No. 9 and 10, Panama Planet, Gokhale Road, Thane (W) 400602. The courses tagged for this centre include CAT, XAT, NMAT, CMAT, MAT, CET and GMAT, plus admission consulting. A second IMS outlet in the same building, IMS Manya, handles GMAT, GRE and study-abroad tests only, so ask for the CAT desk. IMS publishes no Thane fees or centre-wise results on the page.</p>\n\n<h3>2. Career Launcher, Naupada</h3>\n<p>Career Launcher's <a href=\"https://www.careerlauncher.com/cat-mba/coaching-centers/mumbai\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">official Mumbai centres page</a> lists its Thane centre at Office No. 9A, 1st Floor, Ramanand CHS Ltd, opposite Mango Stationery, Gokhale Road, Naupada, Thane (West) 400602. Its <a href=\"https://www.careerlauncher.com/thane\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Thane page</a> lists CAT programmes for first-year and second-year graduates and a crash course, along with classroom sessions, mocks, doubt sessions and one-on-one mentoring. The page gives no fee amounts and no Thane-specific results, so ask for both in writing.</p>\n\n<h3>3. CATKing, opposite Thane station</h3>\n<p>CATKing's <a href=\"https://catking.in/offline-centers\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">official offline-centres page</a> lists a Thane centre on the 2nd floor above Khandelwal Sweets, opposite Thane railway station, Thane (West) 400601, open from 9:00 am. The page names CAT, NMAT, CET, SNAP and XAT among the exams covered and links a CAT 2026 offline/hybrid course. Offline fees are not published; its online CAT courses are listed from Rs 3,999 (crash course) to Rs 24,999 (CAT Intensive). CATKing is a Mumbai-based institute that is especially active in MAH-MBA CET preparation.</p>\n\n<h2>What we left out, and why</h2>\n<p>Directory sites also list T.I.M.E., Endeavor Careers and several local MBA classes in Thane, but we could not find a current official page with a Thane address for them today. iQuanta has a Thane page, but it gives no address. We will add institutes once we can verify them.</p>\n\n<h2>How to choose</h2>\n<p>IMS and Career Launcher are national chains with large mock-test series, and both sit on Gokhale Road, so you can visit both on the same evening. CATKing suits students who also want strong MAH-MBA CET preparation alongside CAT, which matters if you are targeting Mumbai colleges such as JBIMS and SIMSREE. With CAT 2026 on 29 November, most new batches will now be for CAT 2027, so ask whether the batch you join starts from basics or is a test-series-only programme. Sit in a demo class, ask for the batch size, and get the fee in writing.</p>\n<p>See every verified listing in the city on our <a href=\"coaching-thane.html\">Thane coaching page</a>. For the latest MBA exam dates, read our <a href=\"xat-2027-penalty-free-skips-raised-to-12-registration-closes-6-december-12nov-update.html\">XAT 2027 update</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>Last updated: 12 November 2026.</strong></p>\n"
